WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.154 --> 00:00:19.295
badly?" Ben stared at Mog in disbelief.

2
00:00:19.315 --> 00:00:21.096
"That's your big idea?"

3
00:00:21.116 --> 00:00:23.357
"Yeah," Mog said.

4
00:00:23.377 --> 00:00:28.859
"If you're a bad cook, you can't be on Kids' Kitchen Showdown."

5
00:00:30.059 --> 00:00:31.040
Ben shook his head.

6
00:00:32.044 --> 00:00:32.984
"That won't work.

7
00:00:33.305 --> 00:00:36.106
As far as I'm concerned, I am a bad cook.

8
00:00:36.806 --> 00:00:37.306
But Mr.

9
00:00:37.386 --> 00:00:39.547
Icky insists I have natural talent."

10
00:00:40.808 --> 00:00:42.709
Mog scratched his chin for a moment.

11
00:00:42.729 --> 00:00:46.370
"I know what to do.

12
00:00:47.371 --> 00:00:51.193
Every time you're about to make a choice while you're cooking, stop yourself.

13
00:00:52.633 --> 00:00:54.634
Then make the opposite choice."

14
00:00:56.035 --> 00:00:56.975
Ben smiled.

15
00:00:56.995 --> 00:00:58.536
"I'll try it!"

16
00:01:00.876 --> 00:01:02.857
The morning's recipe was creeploaf.

17
00:01:04.437 --> 00:01:06.418
Ben went into the pantry for ingredients.

18
00:01:07.978 --> 00:01:10.379
He was about to grab a jar of pickled bat ears.

19
00:01:10.859 --> 00:01:12.019
Then he stopped himself.

20
00:01:12.039 --> 00:01:17.741
"Pickled bat ears might be delicious in creeploaf," he told himself.

21
00:01:17.761 --> 00:01:21.342
"That's why I need to grab something different."

22
00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:23.883
Ben looked at the shelves.

23
00:01:25.163 --> 00:01:28.604
Up on the top shelf, he saw a jar of powdered snake fangs.

24
00:01:32.812 --> 00:01:33.513
He grabbed it.

25
00:01:35.754 --> 00:01:39.577
Every time he was about to pick an item off the shelf, he stopped himself.

26
00:01:40.398 --> 00:01:42.159
Then he picked a different item.

27
00:01:44.141 --> 00:01:48.064
Soon Ben's arms were full of all sorts of strange ingredients.

28
00:01:48.944 --> 00:01:52.487
He grinned and dumped everything onto his workspace with a crash.

29
00:01:52.507 --> 00:01:57.831
"This will be the worst creeploaf ever!"

30
00:01:58.391 --> 00:01:58.872
he thought.

31
00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:03.221
Winnie raised an eyebrow.

32
00:02:03.241 --> 00:02:06.382
"You're putting black mold in your creeploaf?"

33
00:02:06.402 --> 00:02:12.485
"Yep!" Ben looked over at Mog, who gave him the claws-up sign.

34
00:02:14.586 --> 00:02:17.527
One by one, Ben dumped ingredients into a bowl.

35
00:02:22.469 --> 00:02:24.370
Instead of stirring, he mashed.

36
00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:28.772
Instead of mixing thoroughly, he left big, ugly clumps.

37
00:02:30.752 --> 00:02:34.255
He dropped the mess into a loaf pan and slid it into the oven.

38
00:02:36.997 --> 00:02:39.239
Soon everyone's creeploaves were baking.

39
00:02:42.422 --> 00:02:46.805
Mr. Freaky walked in, his noses wiggling wildly, as usual.

40
00:02:48.147 --> 00:02:52.931
He was followed by Mayor Hubbletree, who adjusted his tie and looked around the room.

41
00:02:52.951 --> 00:02:55.593
"Mr. Freaky!"

42
00:02:56.053 --> 00:02:56.914
Mr. Icky said.

43
00:02:56.934 --> 00:02:59.196
"And Mayor Hubbletree!

44
00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:00.700
What an honor!"

45
00:03:01.641 --> 00:03:03.482
Mr. Freaky blew his noses.

46
00:03:09.424 --> 00:03:12.485
Hubbletree and I were discussing this Friday's TV event.

47
00:03:13.005 --> 00:03:15.707
We wanted to make sure everything is under control."

48
00:03:16.787 --> 00:03:18.188
Mayor Hubbletree grinned.

49
00:03:18.868 --> 00:03:22.749
"Yes, Freaky and I figured we'd pop in to see what's cooking."

50
00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:25.050
He sniffed the air.

51
00:03:25.070 --> 00:03:30.577
"It smells interesting."

52
00:03:30.597 --> 00:03:34.540
"The students are baking creeploaf," Mr.

53
00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:35.201
Icky said.

54
00:03:35.221 --> 00:03:39.685
"Creeploaf?" The mayor wrinkled his nose.

55
00:03:40.786 --> 00:03:42.907
Mr. Freaky's noses stopped wiggling.

56
00:03:42.927 --> 00:03:45.830
"Oh, I love creeploaf!

57
00:03:47.131 --> 00:03:50.014
I remember the creeploaf Grandma Freaky used to make.

58
00:03:50.034 --> 00:03:57.300
It had little cricket legs and Mayor Hubbletree pulled out a handkerchief and wiped his brow.

59
00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:00.461
"That sounds delicious," Mr.

60
00:04:00.541 --> 00:04:01.121
Icky said.

61
00:04:01.141 --> 00:04:04.743
"You'll have to try Ben's creeploaf when he's done.

62
00:04:05.284 --> 00:04:09.166
Ben is Monster Academy's contestant," he explained to the mayor.

63
00:04:10.947 --> 00:04:13.328
Ben smiled and waved to Mayor Hubbletree.

64
00:04:13.348 --> 00:04:18.431
"After they taste my creeploaf, I won't have to be on that stupid show!"

65
00:04:18.711 --> 00:04:19.211
he thought.

66
00:04:20.692 --> 00:04:23.373
Mayor Hubbletree picked up a jar and read the label.

67
00:04:23.393 --> 00:04:25.174
"Leech oil?"

68
00:04:27.015 --> 00:04:27.696
He looked at Mr.

69
00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:31.161
Icky. "You monsters eat this stuff?"

70
00:04:32.922 --> 00:04:35.744
"It's much better for you than butter," Mr.

71
00:04:35.824 --> 00:04:36.404
Icky said.

72
00:04:36.424 --> 00:04:42.528
"I don't know about that," Mayor Hubbletree muttered.

73
00:04:43.488 --> 00:04:45.710
He put down the jar and looked around the room.

74
00:04:47.551 --> 00:04:51.993
A ghoul grinned at him, revealing a set of yellow, crooked teeth.

75
00:04:53.474 --> 00:04:56.636
Ben could see beads of sweat dripping down the mayor's face.

76
00:04:57.532 --> 00:04:58.093
Ding! Ding!

77
00:04:58.113 --> 00:05:01.516
Ding! Timers all over the classroom suddenly rang.

78
00:05:01.536 --> 00:05:04.758
"The creeploaves are ready!"

79
00:05:05.239 --> 00:05:06.260
Mr. Icky shouted.

80
00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:09.843
The students hurried to get their creeploaves out of the oven.

81
00:05:13.886 --> 00:05:15.888
Ben's loaf was purple and lumpy.

82
00:05:16.869 --> 00:05:19.151
When he saw the other loaves, he smiled.

83
00:05:20.071 --> 00:05:21.853
They were all green and brown.

84
00:05:21.873 --> 00:05:25.036
"Perfect!" he thought.

85
00:05:25.716 --> 00:05:27.937
"My creeploaf looks awful."

86
00:05:35.479 --> 00:05:36.259
Mr. Icky said.

87
00:05:36.779 --> 00:05:39.160
The cooking teacher peered at Ben's creeploaf.

88
00:05:42.961 --> 00:05:44.222
Then he looked up at Ben.

89
00:05:44.242 --> 00:05:47.283
"This is interesting, Ben," Mr.

90
00:05:47.363 --> 00:05:47.943
Icky said.

91
00:05:48.723 --> 00:05:51.104
Mayor Hubbletree leaned in for a closer look.

92
00:05:54.444 --> 00:05:56.185
The color drained from his face.

93
00:05:57.425 --> 00:05:59.166
Ben flashed a sheepish grin.

94
00:06:00.166 --> 00:06:01.787
"I'm not sure what I did wrong."

95
00:06:01.807 --> 00:06:05.489
"Very funny," Mr.

96
00:06:05.589 --> 00:06:06.129
Icky said.

97
00:06:06.149 --> 00:06:12.451
"You've obviously been reading The Monster Kitchen by Julia Fang, the world-famous monster chef."

98
00:06:12.471 --> 00:06:14.932
"Huh?" Ben said.

99
00:06:15.653 --> 00:06:19.034
Mr. Icky cut off a piece of Ben's creeploaf and tasted it.

100
00:06:21.835 --> 00:06:23.716
A smile spread across his face.

101
00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:27.741
"Miss Fang says a proper creeploaf should be purple.

102
00:06:28.621 --> 00:06:30.682
That's how it was prepared originally."

103
00:06:31.582 --> 00:06:32.662
He ate another bite.

104
00:06:38.184 --> 00:06:42.305
"Let's see how it compares to Grandma Freaky's," the principal said.

105
00:06:43.286 --> 00:06:46.427
He grabbed a fork and handed a second one to Mayor Hubbletree.

106
00:06:46.447 --> 00:06:47.807
"No, thanks."

107
00:06:48.527 --> 00:06:50.168
The mayor was sweating quite a bit.

108
00:06:51.312 --> 00:06:54.975
"I'm sure this creepy loaf, or whatever you call it, is good.

109
00:06:55.856 --> 00:06:59.539
But I'm not really into, er, fancy foods."

110
00:07:07.366 --> 00:07:09.007
A smile spread across Mr.

111
00:07:09.067 --> 00:07:10.488
Freaky's face as he chewed.

112
00:07:10.508 --> 00:07:13.611
"Well done, chef!"

113
00:07:13.671 --> 00:07:14.772
Mr. Icky said to Ben.

114
00:07:15.552 --> 00:07:17.074
Ben pretended to be happy.

115
00:07:17.874 --> 00:07:19.596
But inside, he groaned.
